{"title":"Comparison Symbols","puid":"c-mat-2-gb/w99q0i","path":"/../c-mat-2-gb/topic-01-number-and-place-value/block-13-comparing-numbers-from-1-to-10/level-02","type":"normal","keyboardLayout":"standardNATENG","voiceLang":"en","voice":"m2_2025","instruction":{"voice":"f3_2025","speaker":true,"autoplay":true},"trainers":[{"trainer":"content","textAlign":"left","atoms":[{"text":"These three signs are called <b><t-yellow>comparison symbols</t-yellow></b>.","soundMode":"a","autoplay":true,"sound":"These three signs are called comparison symbols."},{"lsg":"/../c-mat-2-gb/topic-01-number-and-place-value/block-13-comparing-numbers-from-1-to-10/lsg/comparison-symbol-intro.lsg","version":2,"width":225,"continueButton":true}]},{"trainer":"content","textAlign":"left","atoms":[{"text":"The first symbol means <i><t-yellow>less than</t-yellow></i>. So here we can read <i><b>2</b> <t-yellow>is less than</t-yellow> <b>3</b></i>.","soundMode":"a","autoplay":true,"sound":"The first symbol means less than. So here we can read, 2 is less than 3."},{"lsg":"/../c-mat-2-gb/topic-01-number-and-place-value/block-13-comparing-numbers-from-1-to-10/lsg/less-than-intro.lsg","version":2,"width":225,"continueButton":true}]},{"trainer":"content","textAlign":"left","atoms":[{"text":"Turn that symbol around and it means <i><t-yellow>greater than</t-yellow></i>. So here we can read <i><b>4</b> <t-yellow>is greater than</t-yellow> <b>3</b></i>.","soundMode":"a","autoplay":true,"sound":"Turn that symbol around and it means greater than. So here we can read, 4 is greater than 3."},{"lsg":"/../c-mat-2-gb/topic-01-number-and-place-value/block-13-comparing-numbers-from-1-to-10/lsg/greater-than-intro.lsg","version":2,"width":225,"continueButton":true}]},{"trainer":"content","textAlign":"left","atoms":[{"text":"And this symbol means <i><t-yellow>equal to</t-yellow></i>, so here we can read <i><b>3</b> <t-yellow>is equal to</t-yellow> <b>3</b></i>.","soundMode":"a","autoplay":true,"sound":"And this symbol means equal too, so here we can read, 3 is equal to 3."},{"lsg":"/../c-mat-2-gb/topic-01-number-and-place-value/block-13-comparing-numbers-from-1-to-10/lsg/equal-intro.lsg","version":2,"width":225,"continueButton":true}]},{"trainer":"content","textAlign":"left","atoms":[{"text":"If you are having trouble remembering this, think about how the <i><t-yellow>less than</t-yellow></i> and <i><t-yellow>greater than</t-yellow></i> symbols look like a crocodile mouth. The crocodile is very hungry, so he wants to eat the bigger number.","soundMode":"a","autoplay":true,"sound":"If you are having trouble remembering this, think about how the less than and greater than symbols look like a crocodile mouth. The crocodile is very hungry, so he wants to eat the bigger number."},{"lsg":"/../c-mat-2-gb/topic-01-number-and-place-value/block-13-comparing-numbers-from-1-to-10/lsg/crocodile-intro.lsg","version":2,"width":225,"continueButton":true}]},{"trainer":"content","textAlign":"left","atoms":[{"text":"Here, the crocodile is hungry, so he wants to eat the bigger number. <b>6</b> is greater than <b>3</b>, so his mouth is facing the <b>6</b>.","soundMode":"a","autoplay":true,"sound":"Here, the crocodile is hungry, so he wants to eat the bigger number. 6 is greater than 3, so his mouth is facing the 6."},{"lsg":"/../c-mat-2-gb/topic-01-number-and-place-value/block-13-comparing-numbers-from-1-to-10/lsg/crocodile-intro2.lsg","version":2,"width":225,"continueButton":true}]},{"trainer":"findAll","instruction":{"text":"Select the <b><t-yellow>less than</t-yellow></b> symbol."},"finishButton":false,"atoms":{"a":"","lsg":{"lsg":"/../c-mat-2-gb/topic-01-number-and-place-value/block-13-comparing-numbers-from-1-to-10/lsg/level-02-find1.lsg","version":2,"width":350},"objects":[{"class":"correct","correct":true,"color":"rgba(255,179,0,1)"},{"class":"wrong","correct":false,"color":"rgba(244,67,54,1)"}]}},{"trainer":"findAll","instruction":{"text":"Select the <b><t-yellow>greater than</t-yellow></b> sy